<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Silas" data-copy-zh="Silas">Silas</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Appraisal, Commerce rewards, crafting, shop trade and promotion services." data-copy-zh="鉴定、商业奖励、制作、商店交易与宣传服务。">Appraisal, Commerce rewards, crafting, shop trade and promotion services.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Steal_Valuables"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shop_Purchases_and_Promotion"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Obtaining_the_Key_Item"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Emerald_Dragon_Trade"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Business_Discussion_with_Jade"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats_and_Availability"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Silas — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/silas.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Silas — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/silas.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Silas — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Silas offers Appraisal, two one-time Commerce rewards and Abyssal Looking Glass crafting. His shop’s trade, promotion and equipment services are separate location actions.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Medieval → Kings Demesne → Central Plaza → Exotic Goods Merchant, daily 06:00–21:00. There is no relationship requirement simply to enter the shop.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Exotic Goods Merchant</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>At Known (25), pay $700 for the 120-minute Appraisal lesson, with 10 base affection. Merchant Wisdom needs Known and Communication 70: 30 minutes, Commerce +1 and 10 direct affection once. Money Talks instead requires the Salesman proficiency and gives Commerce +2 and 5 direct affection in 45 minutes.</p><p>For Trade Emerald Dragon, own the house and the Emerald Dragon key item, reach Silas Known (25) and Jade Acquaintance (50), keep Jade home and use the shop 06:00–21:00. The trade takes 120 minutes and consumes the key item, giving Silas 20 and Jade 30 base affection. Business Discussion is a separate shared event, not an additional explicit trade gate.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Business Discussion</th><td data-label="Requirements">Exotic Goods Merchant; 06:00–21:00; Silas Acknowledged (10); Jade Acknowledged (10); Jade not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Silas +5; Jade +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Time Capsule Discovery</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cobbler Shop; 09:00–18:00; Ben Arthur Acquaintance (50); Silas Known (25); Fernando Known (25); Jade Known (25); Jade not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Song_Performance_Reaction"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_Actions_and_Lessons"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Silas</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Exotic Goods Merchant; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Learn Appraisal</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Exotic Goods Merchant; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $700</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+10 base affection; Appraisal; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Craft Abyssal Looking Glass</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Exotic Goods Merchant; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">0 min; 5 Abyssal Eye; 2 Shimmering Heartscale; 3 Soul Thread</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">Abyssal Looking Glass ×1; repeatable while materials last</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Money Talks</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Exotic Goods Merchant; Stranger (0); Salesman proficiency</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+5 direct affection; Commerce +2; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Merchant Wisdom</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Exotic Goods Merchant; Known (25); Communication 70</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+10 direct affection; Commerce +1; once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Abyssal Looking Glass crafting consumes 5 Abyssal Eyes, 2 Shimmering Heartscales and 3 Soul Threads, gives one gift and has no declared time cost. It can be repeated while materials last. With Jade active as a worker, the separate spread-the-word service costs $1000, takes 0 minutes and adds Promotion +1 once.</p><p>The shop sells Perfume for $1000/10 minutes. With house ownership, Aromatic Incense costs $1800 and Scented Candles $400, both 0 minutes; they are maid equipment whose effects require equipping. The shop’s theft option belongs to Alignment and the Thieves Guild, not Silas affection.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 before ordinary affection bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount. An affinity is not itself a lesson offered by this character.</p><p>Intelligence 40; Commerce 30; wealth 15000</p><p>Favorite skill: Negotiation</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection, player experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate. Conversation choices can add rewards beyond event-completion affection.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><p>Salesman proficiency, Commerce and Appraisal are different requirements. Raising Silas affection does not grant a general discount or Negotiation lesson. For the trade, bring the actual key item and Jade home; do not infer a required Business Discussion completion.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships and affection</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Skills</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Locations</a></li><li><a href="character-jade.html">Jade</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-alignment-system.html">Alignment actions</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-infinity-dungeons.html">Infinity Dungeon materials</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Steal_Valuables"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shop_Purchases_and_Promotion"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Obtaining_the_Key_Item"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Emerald_Dragon_Trade"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Business_Discussion_with_Jade"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Progression"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats_and_Availability"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Silas 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/silas.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Silas 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/silas.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Silas 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Silas 提供鉴定、两项一次性商业奖励，以及深渊魔镜制作。商店的交易、宣传和装备服务属于独立地点行动。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>路线为中世纪 → 国王领地 → 中央广场 → 异域商品商人，每天 06:00–21:00。单纯进入商店没有关系等级要求。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">肖像在场时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">异域商品商人</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>已知（25）时，可支付 $700、耗时 120 分钟学习鉴定，并增加 10 基础好感度。商人智慧要求已知与沟通 70，耗时 30 分钟，一次性给予商业 +1 和 10 直接好感度。金钱会说话则要求销售员专长，耗时 45 分钟，给予商业 +2 和 5 直接好感度。</p><p>翡翠巨龙交易要求拥有宅邸、持有翡翠巨龙关键物品，Silas 达到已知（25）、Jade 达到相识（50），并在 Jade 未度假时于 06:00–21:00 进行。交易耗时 120 分钟，会消耗关键物品，给予 Silas 20、Jade 30 基础好感度。共同的生意讨论是另一项事件，不是交易额外明确要求的前置。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">生意讨论</th><td data-label="条件">异域商品商人; 06:00–21:00; Silas 已遇见 (10); Jade 已遇见 (10); Jade 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Silas +5; Jade +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">发现时间胶囊</th><td data-label="条件">鞋匠铺; 09:00–18:00; Ben Arthur 相识 (50); Silas 已知 (25); Fernando 已知 (25); Jade 已知 (25); Jade 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Song_Performance_Reaction"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_Actions_and_Lessons"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Silas 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">异域商品商人; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 4次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">学习鉴定</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">异域商品商人; 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $700</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+10 基础好感度; 鉴定; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">制作深渊魔镜</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">异域商品商人; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">0 分钟; 5 深渊之眼; 2 微光心鳞; 3 灵魂之线</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">深渊魔镜 ×1；材料足够即可重复</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">金钱会说话</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">异域商品商人; 陌生人 (0); 销售员专长</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+5 直接好感度; 商业 +2; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">商人智慧</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">异域商品商人; 已知 (25); 沟通 70</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+10 直接好感度; 商业 +1; 一次性</td></tr></tbody></table><p>制作深渊魔镜消耗 5 深渊之眼、2 微光心鳞与 3 灵魂之线，取得一件礼物，没有额外耗时；材料足够即可重复。Jade 已是在职员工时，独立的宣传服务消耗 $1000、耗时 0 分钟，一次性增加宣传等级 1。</p><p>商店以 $1000、10 分钟出售香水。拥有宅邸后，还可购买 $1800 的芳香熏香及 $400 的香薰蜡烛，均为 0 分钟；它们是女仆装备，需要装备后才生效。店内偷窃选项属于阵营与盗贼公会系统，不属于 Silas 好感度行动。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：好感度加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。直接奖励仍按标明的直接数值加入。偏好技能本身不代表该角色会教授它。</p><p>智力 40; 商业 30; wealth 15000</p><p>偏好技能：谈判</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。消耗为基础值，适用技能与当前加成可能改变实际数值。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；对话选择可能在事件完成好感度之外追加奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>常见卡点</h2><p>销售员专长、商业属性与鉴定是不同条件。提高 Silas 好感度不会额外开放通用折扣或谈判术课程。交易时要带上真正的关键物品，并让 Jade 结束度假；不必额外假定已经完成生意讨论。</p></section>
